# Pogo Climb : ปีนแพลตฟอร์มให้สูงที่สุด กดค้าง=เอียงขวา ปล่อย=เอียงซ้าย (ทะลุขอบจอได้) แผ่นประ=พัง กล่อง=สปริงกระโดดสูง
title Pogo Climb
fps 30
init
x = 60
y = 40
v = -9
m[0] = 52
m[8] = 58
m[24] = 1
m[32] = 52
i = 1
while i < 7
  m[i + 8] = m[i + 7] - 19 - rnd(7)
  m[i] = (m[i - 1] + 84 + rnd(49)) % 108
  m[i + 24] = 1
  m[i + 32] = m[i]
  i += 1
end
u = m[14]
a = m[6]
frame
cls
if held
  x += 3
else
  x -= 3
end
if x < -8
  x = 128
end
if x > 128
  x = -8
end
v += 1
if v > 8
  v = 8
end
n = y + v
e = 0
if n < 24
  e = 24 - n
  n = 24
end
u += e
z += e
i = 0
while i < 7
  b = m[i + 8]
  t = m[i + 16]
  if v > 0 && t < 4 && y + 8 <= b + 2 && n + 8 >= b && x + 6 > m[i] && x + 2 < m[i] + 20
    if t == 2
      m[i + 16] = 4
    else
      n = b - 8
      v = -9
      if t == 3
        v = -12
      end
    end
  end
  b += e
  m[i + 8] = b
  if t == 1
    m[i] += m[i + 24]
    if m[i] < 1 || m[i] > 107 || m[i] > m[i + 32] + 20 || m[i] < m[i + 32] - 20
      m[i + 24] = 0 - m[i + 24]
    end
  end
  if b > 66
    g = 20 + rnd(8) + z / 250
    if g > 32
      g = 32
    end
    u -= g
    b = u
    m[i + 8] = b
    m[i] = (a + 84 + rnd(49)) % 108
    m[i + 32] = m[i]
    a = m[i]
    k = rnd(10)
    t = 0
    if k > 5
      t = 1
    end
    if k > 7
      t = 2
    end
    if k > 8
      t = 3
    end
    m[i + 16] = t
    m[i + 24] = 1
  end
  if t == 0
    fill m[i], b, 20, 3
  end
  if t == 1
    fill m[i], b, 20, 3
    col 0
    line m[i] + 3, b + 1, m[i] + 16, b + 1
    col 1
  end
  if t == 2
    fill m[i], b, 6, 3
    fill m[i] + 14, b, 6, 3
  end
  if t == 3
    fill m[i], b, 20, 3
    rect m[i] + 7, b - 4, 6, 5
  end
  i += 1
end
y = n
if y > 64
  over
end
if v < 0
  spr x, y, "3C7EDBFF7E3C1818"
else
  spr x, y, "3C7EDBFF7E246642"
end
score = z / 8
num 0, 0, score
